  Version 20261016~sparky9~0 (2026-10-16)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * The slides advance: the slideshow's timer runs while Calamares shows it (running: presentation.activatedInCalamares; QML's Timer is stopped by default, so the first slide stayed for the whole installation)
  * The boot menu names the system Sparky Stereo OS (bootloaderEntryName); the EFI folder keeps its name through efiBootloaderId in calamares-settings-sparky-stereo

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261014~sparky9~1 (2026-10-14)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * All twenty-three slides, as stereo pictures without text
  * The words are QML text (qsTr) set at the screen plane, translated through lang/calamares-sparky_<locale>.qm, English the source: the pictures carry no word, so one picture serves every language

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261014~sparky9~0 (2026-10-14)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * First version: the installer's slideshow as six stereo slides (full side by side, left eye first, PNG with the sTER chunk) through stereo-layer's QML item, run in a window of its own (slideshowWindow, in the patched calamares package)
  * Branding name sparky, found first in /etc/calamares/branding as Calamares looks there before /usr/share, so SparkyLinux's own branding and settings.conf stay untouched
  * Sparky's logo and welcome picture are linked from its own branding, not copied
